      <h1 style="font-size:2rem;line-height:1.35;">US Chip Export Controls Escalate in 2026: The MATCH Act, Micron's Lobbying, and China's Computing Autonomy</h1>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>2026-05-09</span>
        {tags.filter(Boolean).map(t => <span class="tag">{t}</span>)}
